msgctxt "87\t136"
msgid "I hear that right!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "137\t208"
msgid "You want the fourth chairman\\nback in the fold!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "215\t275"
msgid "That's correct."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276\t445"
msgid ""
"With the sixth chairman indisposed...\\nthe Tojo Clan lacks an anchor to "
"hold us steady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "446\t706"
msgid ""
"For now we must assume the worst, meaning the only\\nway forward... is "
"finding a satisfactory replacement."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "707\t755"
msgid "The shit?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756\t810"
msgid "I must agree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "821\t880"
msgid "Mine, you fuckin' dog!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "881\t934"
msgid "Kanda-aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "935\t1041"
msgid "Asking Kiryu-san to step in\\nmakes the most sense at present."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1042\t1101"
msgid "Bullshit it does!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1102\t1157"
msgid "Captain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1158\t1291"
msgid "My oath was sworn to the sixth chairman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1296\t1428"
msgid "In any other circumstance,\\nI'd suggest waiting for Daigo-san's return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1429\t1555"
msgid "But the Omi Alliance is breathing down our necks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1556\t1781"
msgid ""
"Hence, I believe it prudent to find a stopgap.\\nAt least until Daigo-san is"
" well enough to rejoin us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1773\t1822"
msgid "Agreed."
msgstr "Concordo."

msgctxt "1823\t1897"
msgid "Bunch of fuckin' cowards!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1935\t2065"
msgid "This is about honor!\\nNot sittin' on your goddamn asses!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2066\t2188"
msgid "All those stocks must've melted\\nyour brain into mush, Mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2189\t2299"
msgid "I'm with Kanda on this one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2309\t2393"
msgid "The only thing a yakuza should be thinking about..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2394\t2507"
msgid "Is getting revenge for their maybe-dying chairman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2534\t2576"
msgid "Hamazaki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2577\t2626"
msgid "Captain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2627\t2758"
msgid "If my sources are right,\\nthe man who shot our sixth chairman..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2759\t2897"
msgid "Was a dead ringer for the late\\nShintaro Kazama. Ring any bells?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2898\t2974"
msgid "Hamazaki... The shit're you gettin' at!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2975\t3044"
msgid "The shit is he gettin' at!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3060\t3241"
msgid "According to an aide to the sixth chairman,\\nwhen Daigo was shot..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3248\t3384"
msgid ""
"He was alone in his office with\\na man who looked like Patriarch Kazama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3438\t3566"
msgid "Not like he rose from the grave\\nfor this nonsense, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3567\t3653"
msgid "Someone else must've pulled the trigger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3654\t3774"
msgid "Captain. You don't know who it was, do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3784\t3834"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3835\t3919"
msgid "Not even the slightest idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3931\t4034"
msgid "You ask me, the best thing\\nfor the Tojo right now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4035\t4241"
msgid ""
"Is finding who filled our chairman with lead\\nand figuring out who's "
"gunning for us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4262\t4437"
msgid ""
"We can discuss whether Kiryu-san should\\nreturn after those are taken care "
"of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4477\t4537"
msgid "You're wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4573\t4722"
msgid "Solidifying the clan must be\\nour primary course of action."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4723\t4974"
msgid ""
"If we fail to recruit Kiryu-san at this vital moment,\\nwe risk the entire "
"organization crumbling to pieces."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5207\t5302"
msgid "Kiryu, Kiryu, Kiryu, Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5303\t5367"
msgid "You pricks in love with the guy!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5400\t5530"
msgid "If you're jonesin' for Kiryu that bad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5582\t5692"
msgid "...I'll bring you his goddamn head on a plate!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5693\t5747"
msgid "Kanda!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5748\t5877"
msgid "And Cap. I got another truth bomb for ya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5878\t6065"
msgid ""
"Ain't a chance in hell the Nishikiyama Family's\\ntakin' orders from that "
"waste of life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6069\t6291"
msgid ""
"With what Kiryu did to the top boys before me...\\nthe family's takin' a "
"hard stance on this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6292\t6431"
msgid ""
"Pretty sure your \"hard stance\" had you locked up\\nfor sex crimes while "
"all that was going down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6432\t6486"
msgid "This ain't a damn joke!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6487\t6628"
msgid ""
"The Nishikiyama Family's about ready to\\nslice that backstabbin' bitch in "
"half!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6629\t6811"
msgid ""
"I got half a mind to just get it over with...\\nand become the next chairman"
" myself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6812\t6892"
msgid "Kiryu's an enemy of the Tojo Clan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6893\t6992"
msgid "I'm gonna tear him limb from limb!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6993\t7112"
msgid "Afraid I can't let you do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7113\t7160"
msgid "Oh yeah!?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

msgctxt "7161\t7262"
msgid "By all means, get rid of Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7270\t7445"
msgid ""
"But letting you Nishikiyama brats run the clan?\\nWell that's just not gonna"
" fly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7446\t7527"
msgid "Right, Captain?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7528\t7687"
msgid "What are you talking about?\\nThis is no time to discuss succession!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7691\t7799"
msgid "Says the guy pining for Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7810\t7930"
msgid "Neither Kanda nor I want him back, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7931\t7990"
msgid "Hamazaki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8000\t8211"
msgid ""
"If we ask Kiryu-san to do us a solid now,\\nhe might just stick around, "
"become seventh chairman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8214\t8333"
msgid "Can't let that slide. Right, Mine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8472\t8595"
msgid "Wonder what the mute mutt\\nthinks of all this, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8619\t8719"
msgid "Well, Majima-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8749\t8841"
msgid "You're just as much a part of this as we are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8842\t8913"
msgid "Lay it on us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9094\t9148"
msgid "Morons."
msgstr "Coglioni."

msgctxt "9269\t9356"
msgid "Do what ya wanna do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9371\t9451"
msgid "Doesn't matter to me either way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9464\t9524"
msgid "What're you playin' at!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9527\t9634"
msgid "Go on your wild ghost chase for Kazama-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9635\t9727"
msgid "Or have Kiryu-chan bust your skulls open."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9752\t9812"
msgid "I just don't give a damn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9938\t10064"
msgid "Oh yeah. Before I split."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10148\t10230"
msgid "You three can brawl if ya want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10251\t10342"
msgid "But if ya even think of goin' for my turf..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10375\t10507"
msgid "Kazama-san won't be the only ghost in town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10590\t10637"
msgid "Majima..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10671\t10731"
msgid "Peace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10916\t11038"
msgid "Kiryu-chan...\\nThe storm's comin' for ya."
msgstr ""
